NEMC Tan Lobby Solver local copy
================================

The original upstream repository
(github.com/Happy2018new/nemc-tan-lobby-solver) was deleted by its author.
This local copy retains only the components used by CubeDock.

Subdirectories retain their upstream MIT licenses and copyright notices:

- minecraft/        gophertunnel, Copyright (c) 2019 Sandertv (MIT)
- protocol/         gophertunnel, Copyright (c) 2019 Sandertv (MIT)
- core/raknet/      go-raknet, Copyright (c) 2019 Sander ten Veldhuis (MIT)
- core/nethernet/   Dragonfly Tech (MIT)
- core/webrtc/      Pion contributors (MIT)
- core/datachannel/ Pion contributors (MIT)
- core/sctp/        Pion contributors (MIT)

CubeDock changes:

- deleted the unused root `main.go` and `debug/` demo programs;
- replaced the previously unlicensed `bunker/` package with a clean-room
  Phoenix TanLobby HTTP client, Copyright (c) 2026 emuyx, MIT;
- added this NOTICE, the local README, and a root LICENSE for the local glue.

The subdirectory licenses remain in force and are not overridden by the root
LICENSE. No source from the original unlicensed root glue or demo programs
remains in this copy.
